{"id":"f603604bd640c05a","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-index-set.md","title":"Index Set","display":"df-index-set — Index Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-index-set","aliases":["58-df-index-set","Index Set"],"display":"df-index-set — Index Set","depends_on":["[[58-df-set]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-index-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-index-set</span><span>Index Set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-index-set — Index Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,X\\in V\">\\(I,X\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function.md\">58-df-function.md</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IndexSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{IndexSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}index\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IndexSet}_S(I,X)\\leftrightarrow\nI\\in V\\land\\exists B\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}index\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IndexSet}_S(I,X)\\leftrightarrow\nI\\in V\\land\\exists B\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Index set: set labeling elements of a family; any set can be index set</li>\n<li>Indexed family: set function with domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>；不把真类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 当作集合函数的陪域。</li>\n<li>Uniqueness: same index set may label different families; change indexing to biject</li>\n<li>Arbitrary union: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup_{i \\in I} X_i\">\\(\\bigcup_{i \\in I} X_i\\)</span> defined for any index set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory</li>\n<li>Kunen, Set Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ 使用 [[58-df-function.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IndexSet}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}index\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IndexSet}_S(I,X)\\leftrightarrow\nI\\in V\\land\\exists B\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,B).","display":true},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigcup_{i \\in I} X_i","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false}],"bytes":961,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-670","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-index-set.md|58-df-index-set]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["65d9a1e690c32aad","36d7463d215be751"]}